                    "id": "4064421334",
                    "src": "\\textstyle\\ln\\left(\\frac{k_2}{k_1}\\right)=\\frac{E_\\mathrm{a}}R\\left(\\frac1{T_1}-\\frac1{T_2}\\right)\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\ln \\left(\\frac{5.4\\times10^4\\;\\mathrm s^{-1}}{4.2\\times10^3\\;\\mathrm s^{-1}}\\right)=\\frac{E_\\mathrm{a}}{\\left(8.314\\;{\\displaystyle \\frac{\\mathrm J}{\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm K}}\\right)}\\left(\\frac1{273\\;\\mathrm K}-\\frac1{303\\;\\mathrm K}\\right)",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ""
